                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; tab-stops: 309.75pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正大标宋简体; mso-bidi-font-family: 方正大标宋简体; mso-hansi-font-family: 方正大标宋简体">关于选拔学生参加全国中小学生骨干研学实践营的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">为发挥共青团组织育人和实践育人的优势，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-ansi-language: ZH-TW">进一步发挥</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">全国青少年北戴河活动营地<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>共青团中央北戴河培训基地<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN>（以下简称营地）在全国范围内组织开展公益性、示范性青少年研学实践教育的职能作用，推动建立分层一体的研学实践和思想引领工作品牌，营地拟从<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月开始举办首届中小学生骨干研学实践营系列活动。有关活动安排如下。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">一、组织机构<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">指导单位：中国少年儿童发展服务中心<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">主办单位：全国青少年北戴河活动营地<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">支持单位：各市、县团委或中小学校等合作共建单位<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">二、活动时间<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">第<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>期：<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>19</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US>-25</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">第<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>期：<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US>-10</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">第<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>期：<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US>-18</SPAN>日（<U>适合现高三学生</U>）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">每期</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">7</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">天（包括往返各一天）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（后续营期另行通知）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">三、参加人员<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">以学生骨干为主，每期<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>人<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">四、活动地点<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">全国青少年北戴河活动营地<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">五、主要内容<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">以体验式、参与式、互动式、情景式、案例式教学为主，课程分为<SPAN style="COLOR: black">坚定理想信念、体验社会实践、提升综合素质三部分。坚定理想信念包括：基础理论常识、核心价值观、红色基因传承；体验社会实践包括：“工农商学兵”五要素为体系的社会实践体验；提升综合素质包括：志愿服务、基础团务、创新意识、国际视野、学习力、领导力为主的综合素质培养。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">六、注意事项 <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">报名要求：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">以自愿为原则，以市、县团委或学校（以下简称合作共建单位）为报名单位，参训人员以合作共建单位推荐为主，不接受个人报名。原则上，合作共建单位选派<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>名学员和<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>名带队教师（负责集中带领学员参加研学，并协助做好研学期间学员的组织工作）参加。每期研学实践营限报<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>个合作共建单位，额满即止。学员参加研学实践并完成规定任务，将获得全国青少年北戴河活动营地<SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: black">(</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black">共青团中央北戴河培训基地<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN></SPAN>颁发的研学实践结业证书。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">报名条件：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">思想进步、成绩优异、表现积极，在组织中起到模范带头作用的团队骨干。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">培训费用：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">首届中小学生骨干研学实践营（第<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>至<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>期）为期<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>天，<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">学员费用为每人<SPAN lang=EN-US>2450</SPAN>元</B>，费用包括食宿、培训、营服、用品、保险、参观门票、证书、场地、市内交通等相关费用，往返交通费用自理。带队教师在营地的费用由营地负责，带队教师的往返交通费由派出单位负责。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">工作要求：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">合作共建单位要与学生家长及有关部门充分沟通，争取支持。做好报名动员，组织学生了解研学实践及安全教育等工作。与学生家长签订安全责任书。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
